        "@value": "in subparagraph (i), by substituting for subsubparagraph (B) the following subsubparagraph: “(B) in any other case, be punished with imprisonment for a term not exceeding ten years or with a fine not exceeding ten million ringgit or with both, and in the case of a body corporate, be punished with a fine not exceeding twenty million ringgit; or”; and"
